  "design": {
    "idea": "Split-level Acorn Atrium hub teasing the Wick Key gate north, Boss Door east, and elevated r6/r9 return overhangs; push an acorn crate to shadow the west shadow_gate from BOTH the gate brazier and your 1.8x sun-lantern hung on the hook.",
    "kind": "puzzle",
    "beat": "ki",
    "teaches": "Occluding both ambient braziers and your hung 1.8x sun-lantern with a push_block to open a shadow_gate and walk through unarmed.",
    "decisions": 4,
    "expert_s": 50,
    "reward": "hub_access+boss_tease",
    "why": "Central split-level hub of The Under-Root connecting all 4 wings and 3 return cycles.",
